sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Gateway
    participant OrderService
    participant BillingService
    participant DomainEvents
    participant EventHandler
    participant UserService
    participant Kafka
    participant NotificationService

    Client->>Gateway: POST /orders
    Gateway->>Gateway: Validate token
    Gateway->>OrderService: POST /orders
    
    OrderService->>OrderService: Save order (PENDING)
    
    OrderService->>BillingService: POST /internal/order
    BillingService-->>OrderService: Payment result
    
    alt Payment successful
        OrderService->>OrderService: Update to PAID
    else Payment failed
        OrderService->>OrderService: Update to FAILED
    end
    
    OrderService->>DomainEvents: Publish OrderCreatedEvent
    Note over OrderService,DomainEvents: Domain Event (инверсия зависимостей)
    
    OrderService-->>Gateway: Order response (со статусом)
    Gateway-->>Client: 201 Created
    
    DomainEvents->>EventHandler: Handle OrderCreatedEvent
    EventHandler->>UserService: GET /internal/me
    UserService-->>EventHandler: UserProfileResponse
    
    EventHandler->>Kafka: Publish OrderEventDto (с email)
    Kafka->>NotificationService: OrderEventDto
    NotificationService->>NotificationService: Send email/save